{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000099","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000099"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000099","label":"中𤳹","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"中𤳹","mention_ids":["c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p009","quote":"中𤳹"}],"identity_note":"依《殷本紀》的特定敘事建立；個別史實及出土材料對應尚未覆核，不按同名跨卷合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-003-yin:p009"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-003-yin"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"中𤳹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000099","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p009","text":"湯歸至于泰卷陶，中𤳹作誥。既絀夏命，還亳，作湯誥：「維三月，王自至於東郊。告諸侯群后：『毋不有功於民，勤力迺事。予乃大罰殛女，毋予怨。』曰：『古禹、皋陶久勞于外，其有功乎民，民乃有安。東為江，北為濟，西為河，南為淮，四瀆已修，萬民乃有居。后稷降播，農殖百穀。三公咸有功于民，故后有立。昔蚩尤與其大夫作亂百姓，帝乃弗予，有狀。先王言不可不勉。』曰：『不道，毋之在國，女毋我怨。』」以令諸侯。伊尹作咸有一德，咎單作明居。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"中𤳹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000099","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"只依本段對話的君主與事件暫定，不作全篇通用的帝／王匹配。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"三公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"蚩尤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000003","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0154","start":154,"end":158,"surface":"帝乃弗予","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000100","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-003","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin","source":{"title":"史記／卷003","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wiki